        <mxCell id="yHyuapJWuVSy4riDqC-F-16" value="V2&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;in build stage create a file with the name app.txt with some text&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;in test stage check if the file exists&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;in deploy stage copy the file into a new folder named deploy&lt;br&gt;&#39;sh&#39;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;dont forget the workspace cleaning" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
