        <mxCell id="yHyuapJWuVSy4riDqC-F-18" value="V3&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;lets start with config&#39;s for pipeline&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;keep the 3 stages from before add a env named APP_VERSION default value 1.0&lt;br&gt;APP_NAME&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;DOCKER_REPO&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;and in the build stage print a proper message that contains all of those env&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;in the test stage please print the pipeline name dynamically and the build number (built_in env)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
