        <mxCell id="yHyuapJWuVSy4riDqC-F-19" value="V3.5&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;write a python script that can search for a word inside a file&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;the word can be received as an argument to python and and the file path must be taken from env named FILE_TO_TEST&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
